overlong 2-byte slash	7B2261223A22EFBFBDEFBFBD227D	7B22EFBFBDEFBFBD223A2276227D
overlong 3-byte slash	7B2261223A22EFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBD227D	7B22EFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBD223A2276227D
overlong 4-byte slash	7B2261223A22EFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBD227D	7B22EFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBD223A2276227D
overlong 2-byte NUL	7B2261223A22EFBFBDEFBFBD227D	7B22EFBFBDEFBFBD223A2276227D
overlong 3-byte NUL	7B2261223A22EFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBD227D	7B22EFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBD223A2276227D
overlong 4-byte NUL	7B2261223A22EFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBD227D	7B22EFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBD223A2276227D
overlong C1	7B2261223A22EFBFBDEFBFBD227D	7B22EFBFBDEFBFBD223A2276227D
surrogate U+D800	7B2261223A22EFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBD227D	7B22EFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBD223A2276227D
surrogate U+DFFF	7B2261223A22EFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBD227D	7B22EFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBD223A2276227D
CESU-8 surrogate pair	7B2261223A22EFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBD227D	7B22EFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBDEFBFBD223A2276227D
